  {
    "ods": 0,
    "page": 10,
    "section": "G20_2024_3_Recommendations",
    "arguments": [
      "Developed within the Development Working Group, the Action Plans aim to enhance policy coherence and coordination across all G20 work streams for the SDGs achievement."
    ],
    "source_file": "G20_2024_ArgsSGD0_llama3.3-70b.json"
  },
  {
    "ods": 0,
    "page": 11,
    "section": "G20_2024_4_Scenario_of_Outcome_In_Support_of_a_Successful_Summit_of_the_Future",
    "arguments": [
      "The G20 needs to use the action-oriented momentum of this Summit to accelerate the implementation of the 2030 Agenda by reducing spillover effects and increasing global policy coherence, a lever to tackle slowing and counterproductive effects on the SDGs.",
      "The G20 will have included international spillovers in its updated 2030 Agenda Action Plan and agreed on concrete actions to improve the monitoring of spillover effects and on peer learning mechanisms to co-design appropriate policies to address spillover effects."
    ],
    "source_file": "G20_2024_ArgsSGD0_llama3.3-70b.json"
  },
