    "arguments": [
      "A critical, yet underappreciated, factor in achieving the SDGs is addressing “spillover effects”. Namely, how a country’s actions affect other countries’ efforts to achieve the SDGs. These externalities, or spillovers, must be understood, monitored, and managed effectively through actions by the countries causing them and through international partnerships."
